-# Manual only, by the owner's decision of 2026-10-17 (SE-099, DP-039). It used to
-# answer an `@claude` comment; it holds the API key and `contents: write`, loads
-# the pull request's own hooks (DP-039, unresolved), and the repository holds no
-# key. Run it from the Actions tab with the task to carry out. The comments
-# below that describe the `@claude` trigger and its author-association gate
